kelixip (1.6.4-5) stable; urgency=low

  * sip_servers: use_fqdn_contact, the Contact of the requests sent to a
    server names its domain instead of the bound address, without a port.
    Teams Direct Routing finds the SBC by that name.
  * TLS/TCP transports: a socket error stops the connection cleanly instead
    of crashing its process.

